        "id": "i",
        "text": "Which claim is correct?",
        "marks": 1,
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "A convex mirror forms erect, smaller images and shows a larger view area than a plane mirror."
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "A convex mirror forms inverted, magnified images like a microscope."
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "A convex mirror is chosen only because its frame is curved, not because of the image it forms."
          },
